WEBVTT

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.170
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.510
Japanese <i>yokai</i>.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:27.140
In the name of Backbeard-sama,
you will be extinguished!

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.640
Look after Kitaro for me.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.660
C-Catchick...

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.340
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:16.040
If even this famous shop is going bust,
the recession must be serious.

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.790
Who the hell's governing?

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:20.350
It's not the recession.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.000
Sir, I'd run too if I were you.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:29.650
All the visiting foreign <i>yokai</i>
are talking about it.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.970
That "his" army is coming to Japan.

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:35.370
That a war is starting.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.690
This country is over.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.810
"His"? Who's "he"?

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.900
Huh? Backbeard?

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:51.070
I just felt like someone glared at me.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.660
Not so loud, sir.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:58.520
You may have bitten off
more than you can chew this time, Kitaro.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:01.020
Let's go.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:04.770
In the name of Backbeard-sama.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:10.900
CHAPTER 28

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:15.850
THE GREAT YOKAI WAR

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.980
We weren't able to save
Miminaga and the others...

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:25.610
Let's give that Agnes girl
sanctuary in this forest.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:29.150
Hopefully it will give them some peace.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.660
I agree.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:35.010
But, if the Western <i>yokai</i>
come after her again...

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.210
How about here?

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.850
Nowhere else is open.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.100
Then it'll do.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.310
More importantly...

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.550
help me to destroy this.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:54.990
This Ring of Arcana
should not exist in this world.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.180
Finger Guns!

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.650
Continue.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:08.960
Finger Guns!

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.700
Finger Guns!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.300
Finger Guns!!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.660
Finger Guns!

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.550
Be serious!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:35.360
You destroyed Adele's barrier.
This can't be all you've got.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.810
Are you holding back?

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:42.120
You don't trust me
because I'm a Western <i>yokai</i>?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.810
Kitaro's used too much <i>yokai</i> power.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:48.460
Sorry, but that's all for today.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.820
The Brigadoon Project.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.680
<i>So, what happened where ya guys came from?</i>

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:06.040
<i>The Brigadoon Project cannot proceed
without that ring, you see.</i>

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:09.000
<i>It can't be... Japan, too?!</i>

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.520
Tell us.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:14.110
What are the ones after you planning?

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:17.510
Why do we have to destroy that ring?

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:20.510
We want to help you.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:22.140
So tell us--

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.810
It's a dangerous project.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:28.170
That's all you need to know.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.100
Don't try it!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.470
This time...!

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:03.200
I'll protect our new home!

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:16.590
<i>Kogami kyo nita</i>

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:21.510
<i>Tagami gyo kano</i>

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:32.130
I'm sorry...

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:48.060
Kitaro?!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.440
What's wrong?!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.650
-What is it?!
-What's going on?!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.550
We don't know! He suddenly...

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.940
Kitaro!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.080
-Kitaro!
-Huh?!

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:23.240
A-Agnes...

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:28.200
-C--...
-Catchick?!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.960
Did you do this?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:33.460
What did you do to Kitaro?!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:37.210
I used my magic
to enhance his <i>yokai</i> power.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:41.630
The strain is taking its toll
on the vessel that is his body.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.200
Why?!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:45.760
When I'm finished I'll undo it.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.910
We should hurry.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.250
At this rate his body will shatter.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:54.630
Before that, we need to destroy
the ring once and for all.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.630
He should be--

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.760
You!

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.260
After everything Kitaro's done for you!

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.420
I know that!

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:02.780
I know.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.430
Even so, I still have to...

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:08.890
destroy that ring.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:10.660
No matter what...

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:31.040
Finger Guns!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.650
Kitaro!

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.840
Undo the magic! Now!

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.890
Agnes! The ring's destroyed, isn't it?!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.890
No. I've taken the ring back.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.710
Adele...

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.150
WITCHES' MEAL

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:08.660
AMERICAN <i>YOKAI</i> BACKBEARD

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.590
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"No passing."</i>

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.600
<i>"You're out!!"</i>

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.930
Adele...

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:16.270
<i>Dainaga mi torchi!</i>

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.610
Kitaro!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:26.610
Kitaro?!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.310
Give up.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.950
You think you can resist me?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:40.530
Your behavior needs work,
but you're still a guest of this forest.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:44.030
She's with the werewolf from before,
isn't she?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:48.990
You caught us off guard last time,
but we'll show you our real strength!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.950
We have the geographical advantage.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:55.680
Lure them deep into the woods
and resist with guerilla tactics!

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.380
Japanese <i>yokai</i>,

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:04.170
now that you stand against us
we won't hold back.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:08.550
In the name of Backbeard-sama,
you will be extinguished!

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.860
Wh-What?!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.360
Adele!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:51.450
More Western <i>yokai</i>?!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:04.170
That's right.
Be sure to chew well when you eat.

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.780
Where are you, GeGeGe no Kitaro?!

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.050
I still owe you for last time!

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.080
Take that werewolf!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.110
It's your weakness, silver bullets!

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:32.720
What a beautiful moon.

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:43.850
Didn't you know?

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:49.070
A werewolf is invincible
when there's a full moon.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:55.030
Weak. Oh how very weak.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:12:01.740
Pathetic creatures surviving, protected by
their island country environment.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.270
But that ends today.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.050
The forest...

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:13.910
The GeGeGe forest...

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:22.230
Adele-sama, we've begun the slaughter.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.860
We have the ring.
I leave the cleanup to you.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.570
And Agnes-sama?

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:29.500
I'll take her with me.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.200
She's flying?!

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:34.530
Is that magic, too?!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.720
The ring!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:38.010
Agnes, wait!

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:42.020
Don't go on your own! It's dangerous!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.480
I smell you.

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:50.170
I've found you, GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.140
How amateur.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:21.580
Huh. Foolish stray cat.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:26.340
Have you forgotten the group mass beating
I handed to the lot of you?

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.880
Oh well.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.590
I'll start by shredding you.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:34.070
Daddy Eyeball-san, Sand Witch, run.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:37.350
Look after Kitaro for me.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.470
C-Catchick...

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:44.540
What?!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.670
Kitaro?

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:49.170
What in the world just happened?!

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:50.040
Hmm.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:53.540
His <i>yokai</i> power that was
forcefully enhanced and running wild...

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.190
He has it completely under control.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.760
It's his anger!

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.980
Kitaro's anger at the forest
and his friends being hurt

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.770
has overpowered the magic's control!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.370
My magic?!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.710
Kitaro-san!

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.430
A-whoop!

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.370
Foolish stray dog!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.370
You won't get in Kitaro's way!

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:29.420
Get Agnes and the ring, Kitaro!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.620
We'll take care of this!

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:40.130
Adele, how long do you intend to do
Backbeard's bidding?!

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:43.990
Return to the castle quietly, Agnes.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.230
Kitaro?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.750
Huh?

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:14.560
I am Backbeard.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.960
The supreme <i>yokai</i>.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.030
Is that...?!

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.910
Ah! Backbeard-sama!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.580
Backbeard-sama!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.410
Backbeard-sama!!

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.870
Our master!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:33.640
Backbeard-sama!

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.710
Oh no!

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:40.360
Kitaro!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.950
Backbeard-sama.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.580
We did not expect you to show up yourself.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:56.650
I thought I'd see for myself this opponent
a witch such as you struggles against.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.860
Now, Adele, reclaim the ring and Agnes.

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:01.800
Yes, master!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.570
Arcana, activate!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.810
This light...

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.820
Agnes, are you...?!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.410
Agnes...

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.170
You fool...

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.290
Take off the ring, Agnes!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.350
You can't control that power!

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.120
This is...

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:24.630
the Ring of Arcana's power?

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.560
Backbeard-sama?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.000
Retreat, Adele.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.650
Adele-sama.

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:05.730
We're leaving. Tell the other two.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.880
Yes, mistress.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:12.220
I never grow tired of seeing
this magnificent power.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.350
That's enough...

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.610
Stop it, Agnes!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:06.500
You saw the ring's overwhelming power,
didn't you?

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:12.240
Backbeard intends to use it
to realize his ambition.

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:17.430
The ring isn't gone.
It's merely vanished for now.

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:19.520
It'll come back.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:22.140
And it'll be in this country.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:26.650
It tends to be bound by a land's
spiritual energy fields.

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.320
Please, help me find the r--

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:30.770
Can't you...

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:35.050
Can't you see anything?

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.950
The wounded forest...

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.850
And my wounded friends...

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.530
Fine.

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:54.950
I'll help you find your ring.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:58.240
However...

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>They're near you</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:23:06.520 --> 00:23:08.020
<i>Agnes meets Mana.</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:11.810
<i>Dad, a Western </i>yokai<i> is attacking them!</i>

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:17.030
<i>"The Mad Frankenstein"</i>

00:23:17.150 --> 00:23:19.740
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
